  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fde9e6c05e247ec4ea9eba8397b000e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subject: Hidden Truths
  context: 'I discovered a sealed door on my left, but no matter how hard I tried,
    I could not find a way to open it. There must be something hidden within this
    cave that is needed to unlock the door.


    I believe there may be information
    hidden somewhere on my right that could reveal the secret behind it. My strength
    is fading, and I fear I may never discover what lies beyond that door.


    If
    someone finds this journal, search the area on the left and look for any clues
    that may help you open it. Do not make the same mistake I did, for the secrets
    buried within this cave may cost you your life.'
  logbookBook: {fileID: 1049444014}
