  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fde9e6c05e247ec4ea9eba8397b000e3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  subject: My Final Will
  context: "If you are reading this, I suppose I never made it out. I came here searching
    for the truth behind the cave\u2019s hidden artifacts, but now I fear I will
    die without finding it.\n\nMy campsite lies to the left, along with my hatchet.
    Take it; you may need it more than I do. To the right lies another unfortunate
    soul. Perhaps they discovered something about the artifacts that I never could.\n\nFar
    to the left, I noticed two separate paths, but I never had the chance to explore
    them. Perhaps they hold clues about this cave.\n\nIf you continue my journey,
    be more careful than I was. I only wish I could have seen the truth for myself."
  logbookBook: {fileID: 1049444014}
